<body>
<header class="masthead"><img alt="United States flag" class="usflag" src="data:image/png;base64,"/><img alt="U.S. Department of State seal, reproduced from the reference screenshot for an unofficial interface demo" class="seal" src="data:image/png;base64,"/><div class="brand"><h1>Consular Electronic Application Center</h1><div class="sub">U.S. DEPARTMENT of STATE</div></div></header>
<main class="workspace"><aside class="intro"><h2>Welcome</h2><p>Welcome to the Consular Electronic Application Center! On this website, you can apply for a U.S. Nonimmigrant Visa; apply to renew an A, G, or NATO Visa; apply for an Immigrant Visa; or check the status of your visa application. Applications saved in the administration panel can be verified here using the DS-160 confirmation number, passport number, consular location, and the first five letters of the applicant surname. On this website, you can also pay certain fees associated with your Immigrant Visa application.</p><p>Please note that, in most situations, submitting your application is just one of the steps in the application process. Please select the appropriate application for more information.</p><p>To learn more about obtaining a United States visa or passport, please visit <a href="#" onclick="return false;" rel="noopener">http://travel.state.gov/</a>.</p><div class="map-art"></div></aside><div class="content"><div class="strip"><div class="strip-label">VISA</div><div aria-label="Airport terminal image from user-provided reference screenshot" class="strip-pic" role="img"></div></div><div class="links"><h3>NONIMMIGRANT</h3><ul><li><span class="arrow">▹</span><a href="#" onclick="return false;">DS-160, Online Nonimmigrant Visa Application</a></li><li><span class="arrow">▹</span><a href="#" onclick="return false;">DS-1648, Online A, G, or NATO Application</a></li><li><span class="arrow">▹</span><a href="{{ route('visa-status') }}?type=NIV">Check My Visa Application Status</a></li></ul><h3 class="immigrant">IMMIGRANT</h3><ul><li><span class="arrow">▹</span><a href="#" onclick="return false;">DS-261, Online Choice of Address and Agent</a></li><li><span class="arrow">▹</span><a href="#" onclick="return false;">Fee Payment</a></li><li><span class="arrow">▹</span><a href="#" onclick="return false;">DS-260, Online Immigrant Visa and Alien Registration Application</a></li><li><span class="arrow">▹</span><a href="{{ route('visa-status') }}?type=IV">Check My Visa Application Status</a></li></ul></div></div></main>
<footer class="footer"><div class="footer-icon">C</div><div class="footer-copy"><a href="#" onclick="return false;">Copyright Information</a> <a href="#" onclick="return false;">Disclaimers</a></div></footer>
